{\b BeatSmith}\par\par
BeatSmith turns songs into StepMania dance charts.\par\par
Everything it needs (Python, the audio libraries and ffmpeg) is included in this installer; nothing else has to be installed.\par\par
BeatSmith only reads the songs you give it and writes chart folders into the output folder you choose. It never changes a song folder that has charts it didn't make.\par\par
This software is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.\par
